# The installer binaries are vendor material: mirrored to disk, never committed.
# The git-tracked record is MANIFEST.json + changelogs/ + README.md.
releases/
*.exe
*.dmg
*.zip
*.AppImage
*.blockmap
# keep the small update-metadata yml files (they're text, tiny, and useful)
!releases/**/*.yml

# firmware-history/ (carved Create/module firmware images + per-version manifests) IS committed:
# this is a private preservation repo. Only the large installer mirror under releases/ stays out.
